{
  "an9.39:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 9.39 ",
  "an9.39:0.2": "4. The Great Chapter ",
  "an9.39:0.3": "The War Between the Gods and the Titans ",
  "an9.39:1.1": "“Once upon a time, mendicants, a battle was fought between the gods and the titans. ",
  "an9.39:1.2": "In that battle the titans won and the gods lost. ",
  "an9.39:1.3": "Defeated, the gods fled north with the titans in pursuit. ",
  "an9.39:1.4": "Then the gods thought, ",
  "an9.39:1.5": "‘The titans are still in pursuit. ",
  "an9.39:1.6": "Why don’t we engage them in battle a second time?’ ",
  "an9.39:1.7": "And so a second battle was fought between the gods and the titans. ",
  "an9.39:1.8": "And for a second time the titans won and the gods lost. ",
  "an9.39:1.9": "Defeated, the gods fled north with the titans in pursuit. ",
  "an9.39:2.1": "Then the gods thought, ",
  "an9.39:2.2": "‘The titans are still in pursuit. ",
  "an9.39:2.3": "Why don’t we engage them in battle a third time?’ ",
  "an9.39:2.4": "And so a third battle was fought between the gods and the titans. ",
  "an9.39:2.5": "And for a third time the titans won and the gods lost. ",
  "an9.39:2.6": "Defeated and terrified, the gods fled right into the castle of the gods. ",
  "an9.39:2.7": "When they had entered their castle, they thought, ",
  "an9.39:2.8": "‘Now we’re in a secure location and the titans can’t do anything to us.’ ",
  "an9.39:2.9": "The titans also thought, ",
  "an9.39:2.10": "‘Now the gods are in a secure location and we can’t do 